<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Thief Weapons</h1>
<p>The weapon skills the Thieves' guild teaches, in its hall in Midgaard. Level is the guild level at which you can first practice the weapon there, and Up to is the most you can learn it at the guild (see <a cmd='#'>Help Practice</a>). Each weapon has its own help: help and the weapon's name.
</p>
<pre>Name             Level   Up to
Dagger               0   80%
Short Sword          2   80%
Club                 4   80%
Fist                 4   80%
Rapier               8   80%
Whip                 8   80%
Scimitar            12   80%
Brass Knuckles      15   80%
Long Sword          20   70%
Stiletto            32   80%
Main Gauche         65   80%
</pre>
<p><br />
See Also:
